1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:00,888
Funny how that works.

2
00:00:00,968 --> 00:00:02,698
We wait months for a plant.

3
00:00:02,778 --> 00:00:04,698
Yet we quit a habit in two weeks.

4
00:00:05,208 --> 00:00:09,338
Two weeks of running, still wiped out.

5
00:00:09,737 --> 00:00:13,306
Forgot: never dismiss a bud.

6
00:00:14,006 --> 00:00:17,657
Two weeks in, it is barely a bud.

7
00:00:18,056 --> 00:00:20,637
How long until a habit sticks?

8
00:00:21,036 --> 00:00:24,103
I assumed two or three weeks.

9
00:00:24,803 --> 00:00:28,193
Lally’s 2010 study floored me.

10
00:00:28,594 --> 00:00:35,064
Fastest took 18 days / slowest took 254, over 8 months.

11
00:00:35,764 --> 00:00:37,754
Reading that, the weight lifted.

12
00:00:38,154 --> 00:00:43,584
Tired at week two is normal.

13
00:00:44,283 --> 00:00:49,353
Count habits in months, not weeks.

14
00:00:49,753 --> 00:00:54,503
Missing one day barely hurts.

15
00:00:55,204 --> 00:01:00,947
Tonight, an easy ten minutes.

16
00:01:01,646 --> 00:01:04,856
That easy pace is just my way.

17
00:01:05,257 --> 00:01:07,687
Anyone else lose steam at week two?

18
00:01:08,087 --> 00:01:12,049
What helps you push through? Tell me.
